    "Connected. Quit Claude (Claude > Quit) and open it again, then ask it something like:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbunden. Beende Claude (Claude > Beenden) und öffne es wieder. Frag es dann zum Beispiel:"
